    TBLeftMargin "\$00\$00"
    "\$01R" "\$04\$00"
    TBFont TBShaston "\$00\$08"
    TBForeColor TBColor7
    TBBackColor TBColorF
    "Acknowledgements"
    TBFont TBShaston "\$00\$08"
    TBForeColor TBColor0
    TBBackColor TBColorF
    "\n"
    "  Thanks to Creative Computing (may\n"
    "they rest in peace) for publishing the\n"
    "original Milestones in 1980.\n"
    "  Thanks to my sister-in-law Gerry for\n"
    "staying addicted to Milestones and\n"
    "inspiring this version.\n"
    "  Thanks to the Top-Secret Beta-Tester\n"
    "Club (you know who you are).\n"
    "  Thanks to YOU for supporting the\n"
    "Reliefware concept.\n"
    "  AND... Thanks to Terri, Matt, & Jeremy,\n"
    "my loving and wonderful family."
    TBFont TBShaston "\$00\$08"
    TBForeColor TBColor7
    TBBackColor TBColorF
};

